  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "ねらった　エモノは　こっそり\nマーキング。　においを　たどって\nゆだん　したころ　ぬすみに　くるぞ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "목표로 한 먹잇감에 슬쩍 마킹을\n해둔다. 냄새를 따라가다 먹이의\n주인이 방심하고 있을 때 훔치려 든다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會偷偷在看中的獵物身上\n留下標記，追蹤目標的氣味，\n在對方放鬆警戒時偷盜。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il marque sa victime pour la suivre à l’odeur.\nSitôt qu’elle est distraite, il s’empresse de lui\nvoler ses biens.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es markiert heimlich die Beute, auf die es ein\nAuge geworfen hat. Dann folgt es dem Geruch\nund stiehlt sie, wenn sich die Gelegenheit bietet.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Marca a su presa sin ser advertido. Sigue el olor\ny, cuando el otro Pokémon baja la guardia,\naprovecha para robarle.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Marca di nascosto le prede interessanti, ne segue\nl’odore per rintracciarle e approfitta di una loro\ndistrazione per rubare nelle loro tane.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It secretly marks potential targets with a scent.\nBy following the scent, it stalks its targets\nand steals from them when they least expect it.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "狙った　獲物は　こっそり\nマーキング。　においを　辿って\n油断　したころ　盗みに　来るぞ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "会偷偷在看中的猎物身上\n留下标记，追踪目标的气味，\n在对方放松警戒时偷盗。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Marca a su presa sin ser advertido. Sigue el olor\ny, cuando el otro Pokémon baja la guardia,\naprovecha para robarle.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "みがるな　からだと　するどい　ツメで\nエサや　タマゴを　ぬすんで　まわる。\nパルスワンが　てんてき。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "가벼운 몸과 날카로운 발톱으로\n먹이나 알을 훔치며 돌아다닌다.\n펄스멍이 천적이다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "靠著輕盈的身體和銳利的\n爪子到處去偷食物和蛋。\n逐電犬是牠的天敵。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Grâce à son corps leste et ses griffes acérées,\nil va et vient en dérobant Œufs et nourriture.\nSon ennemi juré est Fulgudog.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Dank seines agilen Körpers und seiner scharfen\nKlauen ist es ihm ein Leichtes, überall Futter und\nEier zu stehlen. Bellektro ist sein Erzfeind.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Un Pokémon ágil y de afiladas garras que se\nalimenta de huevos y comida robados. Los\nBoltund son su enemigo natural.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se ne va in giro rubando Uova e cibo grazie\nal suo corpo agile e alle unghie affilate.\nIl suo nemico naturale è Boltund.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "With a lithe body and sharp claws, it goes\naround stealing food and eggs. Boltund\nis its natural enemy.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "身軽な　体と　鋭い　ツメで\nエサや　タマゴを　盗んで　まわる。\nパルスワンが　天敵。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "靠着轻盈的身体和锐利的\n爪子到处去偷食物和蛋。\n逐电犬是它的天敌。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
